2026-07-27T14:01:37.7890017Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T14:01:37.7890822Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:01:37.7892103Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T14:01:37.7893298Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
